sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant RM as Run Manager
    participant GQ as Groq LLM
    participant TV as Tavily Search
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>FE: Enter idea and click Generate
    FE->>API: POST /api/generate
    API->>RM: start_run(StartupState)
    RM->>DB: Persist run state (ventureforge_run_states)
    API-->>FE: thread_id + initial state
    FE->>API: GET /api/stream/{thread_id} (SSE)

    RM->>GQ: orchestrator reasoning
    RM->>TV: market_research queries
    TV-->>RM: search results
    RM->>GQ: market synthesis and validator check
    RM->>GQ: business planning
    RM-->>FE: SSE review event (paused)

    U->>FE: Approve/Patch at review
    FE->>API: POST /api/review/approve or /patch
    API->>RM: resume_run(thread_id, patch?)
    RM->>GQ: financial/legal/pitch/mvp/pivot/briefing
    RM->>DB: Persist final run state
    RM-->>FE: SSE complete event

    U->>FE: Export pitch deck
    FE->>API: POST /api/outputs/pptx
    API->>RM: get_run_state(thread_id)
    API-->>FE: PPTX file response
